n><span begin="1:29.420" end="1:29.740">れ</span><span begin="1:29.740" end="1:30.100">ほ</span><span begin="1:30.100" end="1:30.440">ど</span><span begin="1:30.440" end="1:30.600">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.600" end="1:30.880">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.880" end="1:31.100">ち</span></span></span><span begin="1:31.100" end="1:31.300">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.300" end="1:31.480">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.480" end="1:31.760">る</span></span></span><span begin="1:31.760" end="1:31.960">い</span><span begin="1:31.960" end="1:32.080">た</span><span begin="1:32.080" end="1:32.800">こ</span><span begin="1:32.800" end="1:33.160">と</span><span begin="1:33.160" end="1:33.320">だ</span><span begin="1:33.320" end="1:33.640">ろ</span><span begin="1:33.640" end="1:33.960">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">究竟经历了多么漫长的苦旅啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dorehodo no michi o aruita koto darō</span></p><p begin="1:34.440" end="1:39.580" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.440" end="1:34.860">そ</span><span begin="1:34.860" end="1:35.220">れ</span><span begin="1:35.220" end="1:35.540">で</span><span begin="1:35.540" end="1:35.860">も</span><span begin="1:35.860" end="1:36.080">あ</span><span begin="1:36.080" end="1:36.400">な</span><span begin="1:36.400" end="1:36.560">た</span><span begin="1:36.560" end="1:36.740">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.740" end="1:36.900">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.900" end="1:37.200">る</span></span></span><span begin="1:37.200" end="1:37.540">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">続</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.540" end="1:37.940">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.940" end="1:38.240">づ</span></span></span><span begin="1:38.240" end="1:38.603">け</span><span begin="1:38.603" end="1:38.740">て</span><span begin="1:38.740" end="1:38.870">い</span><span begin="1:38.870" end="1:39.580">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">即使如此，你也选择继续前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">soredemo anata wa aruki tsuzukete iku</span></p><p begin="1:39.940" end="1:45.040" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.940" end="1:40.160">た</span><span begin="1:40.160" end="1:40.360">と</span><span begin="1:40.360" end="1:40.640">え</span><span begin="1:40.640" end="1:40.980">あ</span><span begin="1:40.980" end="1:41.360">な</span><span begin="1:41.360" end="1:41.520">た</span><span begin="1:41.520" end="1:41.763">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">傍</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.763" end="1:42.040">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.040" end="1:42.200">ば</span></span></span><span begin="1:42.200" end="1:42.380">に</span><span begin="1:42.380" end="1:42.700">は</span><span begin="1:42.700" end="1:42.880">い</span><span begin="1:42.880" end="1:43.040">ら</span><span begin="1:43.040" end="1:43.520">れ</span><span begin="1:43.520" end="1:43.720">な</span><span begin="1:43.720" end="1:44.080">く</span><span begin="1:44.080" end="1:44.260">と</span><span begin="1:44.260" end="1:45.040">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">尽管我无法陪伴在你的身旁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tatoe anata no soba ni wa irarenaku tomo</span></p><p begin="1:45.380" end="1:51.880" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.380" end="1:45.600">あ</span><span begin="1:45.600" end="1:45.820">な</span><span begin="1:45.820" end="1:46.100">た</span><span begin="1:46.100" end="1:46.440">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">耳</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.440" end="1:46.803">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.803" end="1:46.960">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:46.960" end="1:47.500">に</span><span begin="1:47.500" end="1:47.800">い</span><span begin="1:47.800" end="1:48.180">つ</span><span begin="1:48.180" end="1:48.480">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">届</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.480" end="1:48.820">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.820" end="1:49.180">ど</span></span></span><span begin="1:49.180" end="1:49.520">け</span><span begin="1:49.520" end="1:49.900">た</span><span begin="1:49.900" end="1:50.240">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">唄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.240" end="1:50.380">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.380" end="1:51.880">た</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">终能抵达你的耳边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata no mimi ni itsuka todoketai uta</span></p><p begin="1:53.580" end="1:54.620" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.580" end="1:53.760">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.760" end="1:53.920">ぜ</span></span></span><span begin="1:53.920" end="1:54.100">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">唄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.100" end="1:54.280">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.280" end="1:54.620">た</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">风之歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kaze no uta</span></p><p begin="1:54.620" end="1:56.660" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">願</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.620" end="1:54.940">ね</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.940" end="1:55.140">が</span></span></span><span begin="1:55.140" end="1:55.320">い</span><span begin="1:55.320" end="1:55.640">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.640" end="1:56.020">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:56.020" end="1:56.140">お</span></span></span><span begin="1:56.140" end="1:56.340">く</span><span begin="1:56.340" end="1:56.660">へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">许下的心愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">negai wa tōku e</span></p><p begin="1:56.660" end="1:59.340" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.660" end="1:56.840">ど</span><span begin="1:56.840" end="1:57.000">こ</span><span begin="1:57.000" end="1:57.180">ま</span><span begin="1:57.180" end="1:57.340">で</span><span begin="1:57.340" end="1:57.680">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.680" end="1:57.850">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.850" end="1:58.020">お</span></span></span><span begin="1:58.020" end="1:58.360">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:58.360" end="1:58.600">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:58.600" end="1:58.840">お</span></span></span><span begin="1:58.840" end="1:59.060">く</span><span begin="1:59.060" end="1:59.340">へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">飘向无垠的远方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">doko made mo tōku tōku e</span></p><p begin="1:59.400" end="2:06.240" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.400" end="1:59.580">い</span><span begin="1:59.580" end="1:59.780">つ</span><span begin="1:59.780" end="2:00.060">か</span><span begin="2:00.060" end="2:00.420">ど</span><span begin="2:00.420" end="2:00.580">こ</span><span begin="2:00.580" end="2:00.760">か</span><span begin="2:00.760" end="2:01.120">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歌っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:01.120" end="2:01.440">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:01.440" end="2:01.620">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:01.620" end="2:01.760">っ</span></span></span><span begin="2:01.760" end="2:01.960">た</span><span begin="2:01.960" end="2:02.120">あ</span><span begin="2:02.120" end="2:02.473">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幼日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.473" end="2:02.813">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="2:02.813" end="2:03.100">の</span><span begin="2:03.100" end="2:03.560">よ</span><span begin="2:03.560" end="2:04.820">う</span><span begin="2:04.820" end="2:06.240">に。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">犹如某时某地 那无忧歌唱的孩提时光。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsuka dokoka de utatta ano hi no yō ni</span></p><p begin="2:06.540" end="2:09.340" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.540" end="2:06.900">ど</span><span begin="2:06.900" end="2:07.200">う</span><span begin="2:07.200" end="2:07.560">か</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.560" end="2:08.220">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:08.220" end="2:08.760">き</span><span begin="2:08.760" end="2:09.340">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">请活下去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dōka ikite</span></p><p begin="2:09.600" end="2:12.080" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.600" end="2:09.930">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.930" end="2:10.260">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:10.260" end="2:10.600">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.600" end="2:10.980">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.980" end="2:11.320">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:11.320" end="2:11.500">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:11.500" end="2:12.080">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在那遥远的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tōi sekai de</span></p><p begin="2:12.320" end="2:18.200" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.320" end="2:12.720">あ</span><span begin="2:12.720" end="2:13.040">な</span><span begin="2:13.040" end="2:13.680">た</span><span begin="2:13.680" end="2:14.400">の</span><span begin="2:14.400" end="2:14.740">あ</span><span begin="2:14.740" end="2:15.020">る</span><span begin="2:15.020" end="2:15.250">べ</span><span begin="2:15.250" end="2:15.493">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">姿</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.493" end="2:16.100">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.100" end="2:16.460">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.460" end="2:16.780">た</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.780" end="2:17.120">の</span><span begin="2:17.120" end="2:17.460">ま</span><span begin="2:17.460" end="2:17.620">ま</span><span begin="2:17.620" end="2:18.200">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">作为你本该变成的样子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata no aru beki sugata no mama de</span></p><p begin="2:18.440" end="2:20.200" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.440" end="2:19.140">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.140" end="2:19.640">き</span><span begin="2:19.640" end="2:20.200">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">活下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ikite</span></p><p begin="2:20.480" end="2:23.020" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.480" end="2:20.680">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.680" end="2:21.200">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:21.200" end="2:21.500">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.500" end="2:21.900">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.900" end="2:22.220">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.220" end="2:22.400">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.400" end="2:23.020">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在那遥远的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tōi sekai de</span></p><p begin="2:23.260" end="2:31.520" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.260" end="2:23.600">ひ</span><span begin="2:23.600" end="2:23.900">と</span><span begin="2:23.900" end="2:24.280">つ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.280" end="2:24.620">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.620" end="2:24.920">が</span></span></span><span begin="2:24.920" end="2:25.140">え</span><span begin="2:25.140" end="2:25.660">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">約</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.960" end="2:26.280">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.280" end="2:26.680">く</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">束</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.680" end="2:27.300">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.300" end="2:27.660">く</span></span></span><span begin="2:27.660" end="2:27.860">の</span><span begin="2:27.860" end="2:28.330">ま</span><span begin="2:28.330" end="2:28.723">ま</span><span begin="2:28.723" end="2:31.520">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那被背弃的约定 依旧…</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitotsu tagaeta yakusoku no mama ni</span></p><p begin="2:39.960" end="2:45.000" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.960" end="2:40.380">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.380" end="2:40.640">に</span></span></span><span begin="2:40.640" end="2:40.980">も</span><span begin="2:40.980" end="2:41.300">か</span><span begin="2:41.300" end="2:41.500">も</span><span begin="2:41.500" end="2:41.800">が</span><span begin="2:41.800" end="2:42.020">す</span><span begin="2:42.020" end="2:42.160">れ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.160" end="2:42.360">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.360" end="2:42.540">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.540" end="2:42.700">っ</span></span></span><span begin="2:42.700" end="2:42.860">た</span><span begin="2:42.860" end="2:43.020">の</span><span begin="2:43.020" end="2:43.700">だ</span><span begin="2:43.700" end="2:43.840">ろ</span><span begin="2:43.840" end="2:44.020">う</span><span begin="2:44.020" end="2:44.200">か</span><span begin="2:44.200" end="2:45.000">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你我至今的一切都交错而逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nani mo kamo ga surechigatta no darō ka to</span></p><p begin="2:45.400" end="2:50.480" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.400" end="2:45.740">け</span><span begin="2:45.740" end="2:46.100">し</span><span begin="2:46.100" end="2:46.463">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">取</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.463" end="2:46.800">と</span></span></span><span begin="2:46.800" end="2:46.980">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">戻</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.980" end="2:47.280">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:47.280" end="2:47.440">ど</span></span></span><span begin="2:47.440" end="2:47.640">せ</span><span begin="2:47.640" end="2:47.800">ぬ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">距</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:47.800" end="2:48.120">きょ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">離</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.120" end="2:48.480">り</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.480" end="2:48.840">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.840" end="2:49.160">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:49.160" end="2:49.520">っ</span></span></span><span begin="2:49.520" end="2:49.700">て</span><span begin="2:49.700" end="2:50.480">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我们的距离再也回不到从前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">keshite torimodosenu kyori omotte mo</span></p><p begin="2:50.840" end="2:55.860" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.840" end="2:51.040">あ</span><span begin="2:51.040" end="2:51.220">な</span><span begin="2:51.220" end="2:51.560">た</span><span begin="2:51.560" end="2:51.860">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">差</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:51.860" end="2:52.160">さ</span></span></span><span begin="2:52.160" end="2:52.420">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.420" end="2:52.680">だ</span></span></span><span begin="2:52.680" end="2:52.900">し</span><span begin="2:52.900" end="2:53.060">た</span><span begin="2:53.060" end="2:53.260">こ</span><span begin="2:53.260" end="2:53.580">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.580" end="2:53.760">て</span></span></span><span begin="2:53.760" end="2:53.900">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">全</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.900" end="2:54.620">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.620" end="2:54.980">べ</span></span></span><span begin="2:54.980" end="2:55.160">て</span><span begin="2:55.160" end="2:55.860">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">向你伸出的 这手中的全部</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata ni sashidashita kono te no subete ga</span></p><p begin="2:56.320" end="3:02.720" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.320" end="2:56.500">あ</span><span begin="2:56.500" end="2:56.700">な</span><span begin="2:56.700" end="2:57.020">た</span><span begin="2:57.020" end="2:57.340">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:57.340" end="2:57.680">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:57.680" end="2:57.900">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="2:57.900" end="2:58.380">む</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">助</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.380" end="2:58.660">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.660" end="2:59.060">す</span></span></span><span begin="2:59.060" end="2:59.400">け</span><span begin="2:59.400" end="2:59.740">と</span><span begin="2:59.740" end="3:00.120">な</span><span begin="3:00.120" end="3:00.420">れ</span><span begin="3:00.420" end="3:00.840">ば</span><span begin="3:00.840" end="3:01.050">い</span><span begin="3:01.050" end="3:01.260">い</span><span begin="3:01.260" end="3:02.720">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">若能成为你前行的助力就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata no ayumu tasuke to nareba ii to</span></p><p begin="3:07.140" end="3:12.200" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.140" end="3:07.560">そ</span><span begin="3:07.560" end="3:07.940">れ</span><span begin="3:07.940" end="3:08.260">で</span><span begin="3:08.260" end="3:08.620">も</span><span begin="3:08.620" end="3:08.780">と</span><span begin="3:08.780" end="3:09.100">き</span><span begin="3:09.100" end="3:09.220">と</span><span begin="3:09.220" end="3:09.440">し</span><span begin="3:09.440" end="3:09.600">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.600" end="3:09.960">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.960" end="3:10.100">め</span></span></span><span begin="3:10.100" end="3:10.300">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:10.300" end="3:10.960">み</span></span></span><span begin="3:10.960" end="3:11.320">る</span><span begin="3:11.320" end="3:11.500">の</span><span begin="3:11.500" end="3:12.200">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">却仍旧间或梦见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">soredemo toki to shite yume ni miru no wa</span></p><p begin="3:12.680" end="3:17.720" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.680" end="3:13.040">も</span><span begin="3:13.040" end="3:13.380">う</span><span begin="3:13.380" end="3:13.680">い</span><span begin="3:13.680" end="3:14.080">ち</span><span begin="3:14.080" end="3:14.240">ど</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">並</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:14.240" end="3:14.760">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:14.760" end="3:14.960">ら</span></span></span><span begin="3:14.960" end="3:15.100">ん</span><span begin="3:15.100" end="3:15.400">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:15.400" end="3:15.740">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:15.740" end="3:16.120">る</span></span></span><span begin="3:16.120" end="3:16.360">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">姿</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.360" end="3:16.760">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.760" end="3:16.960">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.960" end="3:17.720">た</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">两人再一次并肩前行的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mō ichido narande aruku sugata</span></p><p begin="3:18.020" end="3:23.080" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.020" end="3:18.320">そ</span><span begin="3:18.320" end="3:18.500">れ</span><span begin="3:18.500" end="3:18.840">が</span><span begin="3:18.840" end="3:19.140">で</span><span begin="3:19.140" end="3:19.500">き</span><span begin="3:19.500" end="3:19.680">な</span><span begin="3:19.680" end="3:20.040">い</span><span begin="3:20.040" end="3:20.200">こ</span><span begin="3:20.200" end="3:20.360">と</span><span begin="3:20.360" end="3:20.540">が</span><span begin="3:20.540" end="3:20.880">わ</span><span begin="3:20.880" end="3:21.220">かっ</span><span begin="3:21.220" end="3:21.570">て</span><span begin="3:21.570" end="3:21.920">い</span><span begin="3:21.920" end="3:22.240">る</span><span begin="3:22.240" end="3:22.440">か</span><span begin="3:22.440" end="3:23.080">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">正因为知晓 这般愿景已无法实现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sore ga dekinai koto ga wakatte iru kara</span></p><p begin="3:23.493" end="3:30.200" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:23.493" end="3:23.780">せ</span><span begin="3:23.780" end="3:23.960">め</span><span begin="3:23.960" end="3:24.300">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.300" end="3:24.640">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.640" end="3:24.940">も</span></span></span><span begin="3:24.940" end="3:25.160">い</span><span begin="3:25.160" end="3:25.620">だ</span><span begin="3:25.620" end="3:25.980">け</span><span begin="3:25.980" end="3:26.340">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">乗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:26.340" end="3:26.640">の</span></span></span><span begin="3:26.640" end="3:27.000">せ</span><span begin="3:27.000" end="3:27.320">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">紡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.320" end="3:27.740">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.740" end="3:28.040">む</span></span></span><span begin="3:28.040" end="3:28.380">ぐ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">唄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:28.380" end="3:28.560">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:28.560" end="3:30.200">た</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">至少让我把思念 寄织在这歌谣里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">semete omoi dake o nosete tsumugu uta</span></p><p begin="3:31.780" end="3:32.820" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:31.780" end="3:31.920">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:31.920" end="3:32.100">ぜ</span></span></span><span begin="3:32.100" end="3:32.320">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">唄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:32.320" end="3:32.480">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:32.480" end="3:32.820">た</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">风之歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kaze no uta</span></p><p begin="3:32.820" end="3:34.820" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">願</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:32.820" end="3:33.140">ね</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.140" end="3:33.340">が</span></span></span><span begin="3:33.340" end="3:33.500">い</span><span begin="3:33.500" end="3:33.820">を</span><span begin="3:33.820" end="3:34.040">も</span><span begin="3:34.040" end="3:34.160">う</span><span begin="3:34.160" end="3:34.320">ひ</span><span begin="3:34.320" end="3:34.500">と</span><span begin="3:34.500" end="3:34.820">つ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">还想许下一厢心愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">negai o mō hitotsu</span></p><p begin="3:34.840" end="3:37.520" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:34.840" end="3:35.000">い</span><span begin="3:35.000" end="3:35.200">つ</span><span begin="3:35.200" end="3:35.520">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.520" end="3:35.880">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.880" end="3:36.020">お</span></span></span><span begin="3:36.020" end="3:36.180">い</span><sp