uta o utatte imasu yō ni</span></p><p begin="3:44.660" end="3:47.480" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:44.660" end="3:45.000">そ</span><span begin="3:45.000" end="3:45.400">し</span><span begin="3:45.400" end="3:45.783">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:45.783" end="3:46.400">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:46.400" end="3:46.940">き</span><span begin="3:46.940" end="3:47.480">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在之后 活下去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">soshite ikite</span></p><p begin="3:47.780" end="3:50.240" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:47.780" end="3:48.110">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.110" end="3:48.440">お</span></span></span><span begin="3:48.440" end="3:48.800">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.800" end="3:49.140">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:49.140" end="3:49.480">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:49.480" end="3:49.660">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:49.660" end="3:50.240">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在那遥远的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tōi sekai de</span></p><p begin="3:50.480" end="3:56.380" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">伝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:50.480" end="3:50.860">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:50.860" end="3:51.220">た</span></span></span><span begin="3:51.220" end="3:51.760">え</span><span begin="3:51.860" end="3:52.580">ら</span><span begin="3:52.580" end="3:52.900">れ</span><span begin="3:52.900" end="3:53.300">な</span><span begin="3:53.300" end="3:53.613">い</span><span tts:ruby="c