ts:ruby="text" begin="4:44.380" end="4:44.700">じ</span></span></span><span begin="4:44.700" end="4:44.980">わ</span><span begin="4:44.980" end="4:45.400">ら</span><span begin="4:45.400" end="4:45.580">ぬ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">影</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:45.580" end="4:46.100">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:46.100" end="4:46.440">げ</span></span></span><span begin="4:46.440" end="4:46.780">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:46.780" end="4:47.120">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:47.120" end="4:47.440">が</span></span></span><span begin="4:47.440" end="4:47.640">え</span><span begin="4:47.640" end="4:48.200">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将那已永远平行的影子再次交叠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">keshite majiwaranu kage o tagaete</span></p><p begin="4:48.480" end="4:50.160" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:48.480" end="4:49.160">い</span></span></span><span begin="4:49.160" end="4:49.683">き</span><span begin="4:49.683" end="4:50.160">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">活下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ikite</span></p><p begin="4:50.520" end="4:53.020" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:50.520" end="4:50.840">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:50.840" end="4:51.243">お</span></span></span><span begin="4:51.243" end="4:51.520">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:51.520" end="4:51.900">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:51.900" end="4:52.220">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:52.220" end="4:52.380">い</span></span></span><span begin="4:52.380" end="4:53.020">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在那遥远的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tōi sekai de</span></p><p begin="4:53.260" end="5:00.220" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:53.260" end="4:53.620">ひ</span><span begin="4:53.620" end="4:53.960">と</span><span begin="4:53.960" end="4:54.260">つ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:54.260" end="4:54.620">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:54.620" end="4:54.940">が</span></span></span><span begin="4:54.940" end="4:55.160">え</span><span begin="4:55.160" end="4:55.680">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">約</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:55.980" end="4:56.260">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:56.260" end="4:56.680">く</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">束</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:56.680" end="4:57.353">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:57.353" end="4:57.680">く</span></span></span><span begin="4:57.680" end="4:57.900">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:57.900" end="4:58.340">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:58.340" end="4:58.700">ま</span></span></span><span begin="4:58.700" end="5:00.220">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">被背弃的约定 如今已然...</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitotsu tagaeta yakusoku wa ima mo</span></p><p begin="5:00.763" end="5:04.640" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:00.763" end="5:01.440">ま</span><span begin="5:01.440" end="5:01.770">た</span><span begin="5:01.770" end="5:02.100">あ</span><span begin="5:02.120" end="5:02.460">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">唄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:02.460" end="5:02.820">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:02.820" end="5:03.100">た</span></span></span><span begin="5:03.100" end="5:03.380">を</span><span begin="5:03.380" end="5:04.160">そっ</span><span begin="5:04.160" end="5:04.640">と。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">——那曲歌谣依旧悠悠响起。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mata ano uta o sotto</span></p><p begin="5:04.860" end="5:07.340" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:04.860" end="5:05.520">め</span><span begin="5:05.520" end="5:05.900">ぐ</span><span begin="5:05.900" end="5:06.240">れ</span><span begin="5:06.240" end="5:06.580">め</span><span begin="5:06.580" end="5:06.920">ぐ</span><span begin="5:06.920" end="5:07.340">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">周而复始</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">megure megure</span></p><p begin="5:07.600" end="5:09.980" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:07.600" end="5:08.080">め</span><span begin="5:08.080" end="5:08.320">ぐ</span><span begin="5:08.320" end="5:08.620">り</span><span begin="5:08.620" end="5:08.940">て</span><span begin="5:08.940" end="5:09.260">き</span><span begin="5:09.260" end="5:09.600">た</span><span begin="5:09.600" end="5:09.980">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">去而复还</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">megurite kitare</span></p><p begin="5:10.300" end="5:13.060" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:10.300" end="5:10.660">こ</span><span begin="5:10.660" end="5:10.980">の</span><span begin="5:10.980" end="5:11.340">か</span><span begin="5:11.340" end="5:11.640">げ</span><span begin="5:11.640" end="5:12.020">ふ</span><span begin="5:12.020" end="5:12.360">む</span><span begin="5:12.360" end="5:12.660">の</span><span begin="5:12.660" end="5:13.060">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">步上这后尘的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono kage fumu no wa</span></p><p begin="5:13.060" end="5:15.580" itunes:key="L67" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:13.060" end="5:13.400">ど</span><span begin="5:13.400" end="5:13.740">ち</span><span begin="5:13.740" end="5:14.060">ら</span><span begin="5:14.060" end="5:14.380">か</span><span begin="5:14.380" end="5:15.580">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将会是谁呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dochira ka to</span></p><p begin="5:15.833" end="5:18.240" itunes:key="L68" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:15.833" end="5:16.500">と</span><span begin="5:16.500" end="5:16.820">も</span><span begin="5:16.820" end="5:17.180">に</span><span begin="5:17.180" end="5:17.520">う</span><span begin="5:17.520" end="5:17.860">た</span><span begin="5:17.860" end="5:18.240">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">一起唱起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tomo ni utau</span></p><p begin="5:18.540" end="5:21.160" itunes:key="L69" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:18.540" end="5:19.080">な</span><span begin="5:19.080" end="5:19.280">も</span><span begin="5:19.280" end="5:19.620">な</span><span begin="5:19.620" end="5:20.000">き</span><span begin="5:20.000" end="5:20.380">う</span><span begin="5:20.380" end="5:20.720">た</span><span begin="5:20.720" end="5:21.160">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这无名之歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na mo naki uta o</span></p><p begin="5:21.480" end="5:24.500" itunes:key="L70" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:21.480" end="5:21.860">と</span><span begin="5:21.860" end="5:22.240">お</span><span begin="5:22.240" end="5:22.620">く</span><span begin="5:22.620" end="5:22.980">か</span><span begin="5:22.980" end="5:23.380">ぜ</span><span begin="5:23.380" end="5:23.780">に</span><span begin="5:23.780" end="5:24.060">の</span><span begin="5:24.060" end="5:24.500">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就让它乘风飘向</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tōku kaze ni nose</span></p><p begin="5:24.540" end="5:28.720" itunes:key="L71" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:24.540" end="5:24.940">か</span><span begin="5:24.940" end="5:25.340">な</span><span begin="5:25.340" end="5:25.780">た</span><span begin="5:25.780" end="5:26.220">へ</span><span begin="5:26.220" end="5:28.720">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">遥远的彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kanata e to</span></p></div></body></tt>